#. Description of the plugin
#: ukraine-health.php
msgid "Connects Heroes (patients in rehabilitation) with Supporters (hairdressers, nail care, clothing, care products, mobility aids…). Requests are grouped per hospital and service; when a group reaches its minimum size, matching Supporters are notified (email, Telegram, WhatsApp) and can accept it with an appointment date."
msgstr ""

